{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00037","headline":"秋日即目 · 太宗皇帝","name":"秋日即目","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爽气浮丹阙，秋光澹紫宫。\n衣碎荷疎影，花明菊点丛。\n袍轻低草露，盖侧舞松风。\n散岫飘云叶，迷路飞烟鸿。\n砌冷兰凋佩，闺寒树陨桐。\n别鹤栖琴里，离猿啼峡中。\n落野飞星箭，弦虚半月弓。\n芳菲夕雾起，暮色满房栊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"太宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00037.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00037","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}